What Was the Big Bang?
Try to imagine something unimaginably tiny, impossibly dense, and unbelievable hot. Then suddenly,
bang!
Space, time, and all the matter in the Universe explodes outward at incredible speed. OK, it might have been a bounce...or a poof...or, like, a weird
smush
